# Close (grip) or open (release) the gripper.
# Grip: fingers close until they touch the object between them (the graspable object whose
# 'grasp' frame is nearest to the TCP) and centre it; a tool without fingers attaches the object
# whose grasp frame is within the grasp tolerance. Release leaves the held object where it is
# and opens the fingers fully. Both take the time the fingers need (report.duration).
bool close
bool check_only   # apply to the check session only; the simulation is not changed
string name       # step name for the report
---
bool success
StepReport report
